  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the proposed project is to contribute to the enhanced resilience and business continuity of the State Border Guard Service (SBGS) of Ukraine at the country&#x2019;s western and southern borders through addressing their urgent needs in line with Ukraine&#x2019;s Integrated Border Management (IBM) Strategy and relevant international standards and good practices.</narrative>
